---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REPO, ISSUES, DISCUSSIONS, SPONSORS, BMC } from "../consts";
---

<Base
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with PhonePad, report a bug, or support development. PhonePad is free and open source."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)">Getting help, and giving it</h1>

      <h2>Something is broken</h2>
      <p>
        Start with <a href="/troubleshooting/">troubleshooting</a> — it covers
        the things that actually go wrong. If that does not help,
        <a href={ISSUES} rel="noopener">open an issue</a> and include what the
        Diagnostics screen shows.
      </p>

      <h2>A question, or an idea</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={DISCUSSIONS} rel="noopener">Discussions</a> is the right place.
        Issues are for things that are broken.
      </p>

      <h2>Supporting development</h2>
      <p>
        PhonePad is free and open source, and the controller is not going behind
        a paywall. There is no premium tier holding your D-pad hostage.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is also a side project, built and maintained by one person in
        evenings. If it saved you buying a controller — or saved you the
        annoyance of one being in the wrong room — you can help pay for the
        time.
      </p>

      {
        SPONSORS || BMC ? (
          <p style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            {SPONSORS && (
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href={SPONSORS} rel="noopener">
                GitHub Sponsors
              </a>
            )}
            {BMC && (
              <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={BMC} rel="noopener">
                Buy me a coffee
              </a>
            )}
          </p>
        ) : (
          <p class="muted">
            Sponsorship links are not set up yet. Until they are, a star on{" "}
            <a href={REPO} rel="noopener">
              the repository
            </a>{" "}
            genuinely helps — it is most of how anyone finds a project like this.
          </p>
        )
      }

      <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Tell someone.</strong> The people who need PhonePad are the
          ones who do not know it exists.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Report what breaks.</strong> A precise bug report is worth more
          than a donation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Share a layout.</strong> A tuning that works for a specific
          game is knowledge nobody else has.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Send a fix.</strong> See
          <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`} rel="noopener">
            CONTRIBUTING.md</a
          >.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
